[[63,7,0,"<h3 class=\"step\" data-step=\"removing\" data-part=\"removal\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/20.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Removing</h3><a class=\"jump\" href=\"#\" data-jump=\"refitting\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/21.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Refitting</a><p>Ensure that the ignition key is in the\nOFF position, then disconnect the negative battery terminal.</p><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2001294.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th><p>Name</p></th><th colspan=\"1\"><p>Connector</p></th></tr><tr><td><p>-</p></td><td><p>Battery</p></td><td colspan=\"1\"><p><span class=\"dead-link\">A1</span></p></td></tr></table></div><p>Carry out \n                                          <a href=\"#/2585221\">7055B54</a>\n                                           .</p><p>1. Disconnect the electrical connection for the rpm sensor.</p><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2001294.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th><p>Name</p></th><th colspan=\"1\"><p>Connector</p></th></tr><tr><td><p>1</p></td><td><p>RPM sensor</p></td><td colspan=\"1\"><p><span class=\"dead-link\">K46</span></p></td></tr></table></div><p>2. Undo the bolt (2a) and remove the engine rpm sensor (2b).</p><figure class=\"photo\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2065758.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure>"],[63,7,0,"<h3 class=\"step\" data-step=\"removing\" data-part=\"removal\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/20.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Removing</h3><a class=\"jump\" href=\"#\" data-jump=\"refitting\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/21.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Refitting</a><p>Position the vehicle on the ramp.</p><p>Ensure that the ignition key is in the\nstop position, then disconnect the battery negative terminal.</p><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2001294.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th><p>Name</p></th><th colspan=\"1\"><p>Connector</p></th></tr><tr><td><p>-</p></td><td><p>Battery</p></td><td colspan=\"1\"><p><span class=\"dead-link\">A1B</span></p></td></tr></table></div><p>Proceed with the removal \n                                          <a href=\"#/2585221\">7055B54</a>\n                                           .</p><p>1. Disconnect the electrical connection for the rpm sensor.</p><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2001294.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th><p>Name</p></th><th colspan=\"1\"><p>Connector</p></th></tr><tr><td><p>1</p></td><td><p>RPM sensor</p></td><td colspan=\"1\"><p><span class=\"dead-link\">K46</span></p></td></tr></table></div><figure class=\"photo\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2021805.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure>"],[63,7,0,"<h3 class=\"step\" data-step=\"refitting\" data-part=\"refit\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/21.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Refitting</h3><a class=\"jump\" href=\"#\" data-jump=\"removing\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/20.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Removing</a><p>1. Place the rpm sensor (1a) in its seating and secure it tightening\nthe bolt (1b) to the specified torque.</p><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2001243.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th><p>Fastening</p></th><th><p>Component</p></th><th><p>Ø</p></th><th colspan=\"1\"><p>Value</p><p>(daNm)</p></th></tr><tr><td><p>1b</p></td><td><p>Bolt</p></td><td><p>ENGINE RPM SENSOR</p></td><td><p>M6</p></td><td colspan=\"1\"><p>(Engine crankcase side) 0.8 ÷ 1.0</p></td></tr></table></div><p>2. Connect the electrical connection for the rpm sensor.</p><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2001294.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th><p>Name</p></th><th colspan=\"1\"><p>Connector</p></th></tr><tr><td><p>2</p></td><td><p>RPM sensor</p></td><td colspan=\"1\"><p><span class=\"dead-link\">K46</span></p></td></tr></table></div><figure class=\"photo\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2065759.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure>"],[63,7,0,"<p>1. Undo bolt (1a) and remove rpm sensor (1b).</p><figure class=\"photo\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2021806.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure>"],[63,7,0,"<p>Carry out \n                                          <a href=\"#/2585221\">7055B54</a>\n                                           .</p><p>Connect the battery negative terminal.</p><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2001294.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th><p>Name</p></th><th colspan=\"1\"><p>Connector</p></th></tr><tr><td><p>-</p></td><td><p>Battery</p></td><td colspan=\"1\"><p><span class=\"dead-link\">A1</span></p></td></tr></table></div>"],[63,7,0,"<h3 class=\"step\" data-step=\"refitting\" data-part=\"refit\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/21.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Refitting</h3><a class=\"jump\" href=\"#\" data-jump=\"removing\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/20.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Removing</a><p>Replace the rear wheel rpm sensor in its\nhousing and fix it using the bolt.</p><p>Connect the electrical connection for the\nrpm sensor.</p><p>Proceed with the refitting \n                                          <a href=\"#/2585221\">7055B54</a>\n                                           .</p><p>Connect the battery terminal (-).</p><p>Remove the car from the ramp.</p>"]]